"origine":null},"立":{"c":"立","pinyin":"lì","lectures":["lì"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L3-0092","L3-0345","L3-0445","L3-0621","L4-0198","L4-0472","L5-0138","L5-0216","L5-0467","L5-0468","L5-0612","L7-0891","L7-0942","L7-1353","L7-1404","L7-1641","L7-2587","L7-2588","L7-2589","L7-2590","L7-2591","L7-2592","L7-3825","L7-3906","L7-3930","L7-4957","L7-5245","L7-5409","L7-5558"],"chemin":{"hsk":133,"lire":102},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"se tenir debout ; établir, fonder","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"se tenir debout ; dresser"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"établir, fonder ; accomplir (un exploit)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他立在门口。","pinyin":"Tā lì zài ménkǒu.","fr":"Il se tenait à l'entrée.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 立 dessine un homme de face, bras et jambes écartés comme dans 大, debout sur une ligne qui figure le sol. Le Shuowen jiezi le définit comme « se tenir » et le lit de la même façon, un homme 大 posé sur 一. Seul, il veut dire « se dresser, établir » ; en haut de 亲 ou de 意, ce n'est plus qu'une forme, venue d'autres éléments anciens.","en":"On oracle bones, 立 draws a man seen from the front, arms and legs apart as in 大, standing on a line that marks the ground. The Shuowen jiezi defines it as “to stand” and reads it the same way, a man 大 set on 一. On its own it means “to stand up, to set up”; at the top of 亲 or 意 it is only a shape, which grew out of other old elements.","roles":{}}},"粒":{"c":"粒","pinyin":"lì","lectures":["lì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["米","立"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2597"],"chemin":{"hsk":1141,"lire":1134},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"grain ; classificateur des petits objets","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"grain, granule"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"classificateur des petits objets ronds (grain, comprimé)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他每天吃两粒药。","pinyin":"Tā měi tiān chī liǎng lì yào.","fr":"Il prend deux comprimés par jour.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"隶":{"c":"隶","pinyin":"lì","lectures":["lì"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L7-3034"],"chemin":{"hsk":289,"lire":293},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"dépendre de ; esclave","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"dépendre de, relever de"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"esclave, serviteur"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"俩":{"c":"俩","pinyin":"liǎ","lectures":["liǎ","liǎng"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","两"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0475"],"chemin":{"hsk":537,"lire":530},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"deux, tous les deux","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Num","fr":"deux, tous les deux : familier"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我们俩是同学。","pinyin":"Wǒmen liǎ shì tóngxué.","fr":"Lui et moi, nous sommes camarades de classe.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"帘":{"c":"帘","pinyin":"lián","lectures":["lián"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["穴","巾"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0136","L7-2605"],"chemin":{"hsk":677,"lire":670},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"rideau, store","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"rideau, store"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"门口挂着一个布帘子。","pinyin":"Ménkǒu guà zhe yī ge bù liánzi.","fr":"Un rideau de tissu pend devant la porte.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"廉":{"c":"廉","pinyin":"lián","lectures":["lián"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["广","兼"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2610","L7-2611","L7-2612","L7-2613"],"chemin":{"hsk":1142,"lire":1135},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"honnête, intègre ; bon marché","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"honnête, intègre"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"bon marché, peu coûteux"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这家店的东西物美价廉。","pinyin":"Zhè jiā diàn de dōngxi wùměi-jiàlián.","fr":"Dans cette boutique, les articles sont bons et pas chers.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"怜":{"c":"怜","pin